        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-cyber-blue">precision_manufacturing</span>
        Corporate Profile &amp; Governance
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-heading-gold text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl text-rich-gold tracking-tight font-bold">
        Engineering Excellence &amp; Leadership Profile
