      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-100 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Emerging high-precision tooling and manufacturing powerhouse based in Thirumudivakkam, Chennai. We engineer injection molds, rubber dies, and vertical insert molding systems built to sub-micron tolerances for mission-critical automotive, medical, and electronic assemblies.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-3 bg-dark-slate p-6 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-rich-gold/15">
