              CORE PRODUCTION FLOOR • 1,500 SQ. FT.
            </span>
            <span class="font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-rich-gold font-bold">ZONE: SHOPFLOOR-HEAVY</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-rich-gold font-bold">
            Precision Mold Manufacturing &amp; High-Tolerance Machining
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 leading-relaxed">
            Engineered with climate-controlled zones, rigid anti-vibration machine footings, and high-capacity electrical distribution to run simultaneous continuous 3-axis VMC roughing and ultra-fine finishing routines.
          </p>
          <!-- Inline Micro Metric Specs: Clear High Contrast -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-2">
            <div class="bg-navy-deep/90 p-4 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/25">
