        RIGID CALIBRATION CYCLE • ZERO DRIFT
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Machine 1: Makino VMC -->
      <div class="card-tech-gold rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-rich-gold transition-all">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
