          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-dark-slate border border-rich-gold/40 text-rich-gold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide">1x MACHINE DEPLOYED</span>
