          </p>
          <div class="bg-navy-deep/90 p-4 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono">
              <span class="text-slate-300 font-medium">Primary Domain</span>
